
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>DAO Tech</title>

<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

body{
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);
color:white;
text-align:center;
}

header{
padding:60px 20px;
}

h1{
font-size:3rem;
}

p{
margin-top:15px;
font-size:1.1rem;
}

.btn{
display:inline-block;
margin-top:20px;
padding:12px 25px;
background:#22c55e;
color:white;
text-decoration:none;
border-radius:10px;
font-weight:bold;
}

.cards{
display:flex;
flex-wrap:wrap;
justify-content:center;
gap:20px;
padding:40px;
}

.card{
background:#334155;
padding:20px;
border-radius:15px;
width:250px;
}

footer{
padding:20px;
background:#0f172a;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<h1>Bienvenue sur DAO Tech</h1>
<p>Mon premier site créé avec Termux</p>
<a href="#" class="btn">Découvrir</a>
</header>

<section class="cards">
<div class="card">
<h2>Programmation</h2>
<p>Python, HTML, CSS et JavaScript.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>Robotique</h2>
<p>Arduino et projets intelligents.</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>IA</h2>
<p>Découverte de l'intelligence artificielle.</p>
</div>
</section>

<footer>
<p>© 2026 DAO IBRAHIM</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
